{
	"name": "Holepuncher",
	"type": "maneuver",
	"img": "icons/weapons/guns/gun-blunderbuss-gold.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>By overloading your weapon, you initiate a blast meant to knock doors off hinges and punch holes through walls. As an action, you prepare and fire a breaching charge into a two handed firearm that you have readied. Doing so allows you to make an attack roll against the DC to break down a door within 15ft of you or punch a hole large enough for a medium sized creature to crawl through in a wall no more than 6 inches thick. If a creature is within 5ft of the door or wall, on either side, they must make a Dexterity saving throw or take damage as if you hit them, twice, with the firearm. On a successful save, they take no damage.</p>",
